{"id": "86192", "name": "שינוי נושא נוסחה – r² = V(h − a), בידוד a (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Rearrange \\({{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}}\\) and make \\(a\\) the subject of the formula.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a\\) = [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> To rearrange formulae perform operations to both sides of the formulae to obtain an equation with \\(a\\) as the subject.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Open the brackets</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:1}}. \\]</p>The aim is to get \\(a\\) on the opposite side of the equation to the other constants/variables. In order to do this it is clear we must 'free' the \\(a\\) from the brackets. We do this by multiplying out \\({{CT:1}}\\) which gives:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} = {{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Move the term without \\(a\\)</b><br>Subtract \\({{CT:3}}\\) from both sides:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} = {{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Divide by the coefficient of \\(a\\)</b><br>Divide by \\({{CT:6}}\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:7}} = {{CT:8}}. \\]</p>You now have an equation for \\(a\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta"], "nvariants": 1}